### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Generate Sample Listings
POST {{baseUrl}}/generate-listings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "num_listings": 10
}

### Search Listings
POST {{baseUrl}}/search-listings?min_price=400000&max_price=800000&min_bedrooms=3&min_bathrooms=2&min_size=2000&n_results=5
Content-Type: application/json

[
    "A comfortable three-bedroom house with a spacious kitchen",
    "A quiet neighborhood with good schools",
    "Modern amenities and a backyard",
    "Close to public transportation",
    "Suburban area with easy access to shops"
]

### Image Search
POST {{baseUrl}}/image-search
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryABC123

------WebKitFormBoundaryABC123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="sample_house.jpeg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./data/sample_house.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundaryABC123--


